WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.000
Why is it that when you finally say no, people say you've changed?

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:08.125
For years you said yes.

3
00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:10.725
You stayed late.

4
00:00:11.725 --> 00:00:14.175
You picked up on the second ring.

5
00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:18.625
You lent the money and never asked for it back.

6
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.275
Nobody called that a personality.

7
00:00:23.225 --> 00:00:25.125
They called it normal.

8
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.500
Then one tired Tuesday, you said no.

9
00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:31.575
Once.

10
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.200
And that was the day they decided who you really are.

11
00:00:37.775 --> 00:00:39.525
You haven't changed.

12
00:00:40.825 --> 00:00:42.850
You've stopped disappearing.

13
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.575
Next time, say it again.

14
00:00:47.575 --> 00:00:48.925
Out loud.

15
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.450
And tell me in the comments what you said no to.
